{"id":"sirena","lemma":"sirena","pos":"noun","rank":3730,"glosses":["siren (device)","mermaid, siren (mythological creature)","siren (seductive woman)"],"ipa":"/siˈɾena/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"sirenas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c2/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-sirena.wav","examples":[{"text":"Yo escucho sirenas.","en":"I hear sirens.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/440308","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"I'm all ears awaiting…"},null]},{"text":"La sirena sonó.","en":"The siren blew.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/301181","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to sound, to ring","l":"sonar"}]},{"text":"La cautivadora voz de la sirena atrajo a los marineros a la zona más peligrosa de los acantilados.","en":"The mermaid's captivating voice lured the sailors to the cliff's most dangerous area.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/820009","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"voice"},null,null,null,{"g":"to attract, to lure","l":"atraer"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"sailor, seaman","l":"marinero"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"zone, district, area"},{"g":"more"},{"g":"perilous, dangerous","l":"peligroso"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"steep, sheer","l":"acantilado"}],"phrases":[[3,5,"of the"]]}]}